" ~/.vim/theme.vim - written by mysetup (--do theme). Regenerated whenever the
" colour scheme changes, which is why it is its own file: ~/.vimrc never has to
" be rewritten to change a theme, so its diff stays about vim settings only.
" Flavour: {{THEME_FLAVOUR}}
if has('termguicolors')
  set termguicolors
endif
" silent! so a missing colorscheme file degrades to vim's default instead of
" throwing an error on every startup.
silent! colorscheme {{VIM_COLORSCHEME}}
